For completeness, specializing [TR, (105.4)] gives the following Kraus
list for $\Phi$:

$$
\operatorname{diag}(1,1/4,0),\quad
\tfrac34 E_{11},\quad
\sqrt{3/8}\,E_{21},\quad
\sqrt{3/8}\,E_{12},\quad
\sqrt{5/8}\,E_{22}.
\tag{130.2}
$$

Their adjoint products sum to $I_3$ and give (127.4) on every complex
matrix. 